# Bootstrap package for workspace-level application concerns.
#
# A Workspace is the operational scope within an Organization.
# WorkspaceMembership entities (User + Organization + Role) are
# owned by the devflow-auth module.
#
# This package is reserved for application-level workspace context
# management: active workspace resolution, workspace context switching,
# and workspace-scoped request interceptors.
#
# Reference: docs/architecture/DOMAIN_MODEL.md §3.1
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §8.1 (Workspace Isolation Model)
